// Title: a type-mismatch diagnostic prints a shared type DAG in full: 2^n output, and the check OOMs (x-rerun-2-01 variant)
// Command: timeout -s KILL 150 /home/eric/tmp/review-2026-10-26/bin/graphix --check design/review-2026-10-26/repro/x-rerun-4-dag-type-mismatch-oom.gx
// Expected: refused promptly with a bounded message ("type mismatch i64 does not contain `A(..…"),
//   as fusion's refusals now are (fusion::Brief, 512 bytes).
// Observed: "[probe] OOM-KILLED" past the 6 GB cap after ~57 s. At 20/22/24 levels the
//   check takes 0.12/0.36/1.3 s; at 28 levels 24 s and a 2.4 GB error message.
//   TypeMismatch's Display (graphix-types/src/typ/contains.rs) formats both sides with
//   format_compact! before writing them.
